## 📂 Repository Architecture

```text
euroleague-quant-engine/
├── src/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── metrics.py       # USG%, TS%, and team PPP aggregation algorithms
│   ├── rotation.py      # Positional minutes redistribution engine
│   └── pricing.py       # Fair odds, margin insertion, and de-vigging
├── data/
│   └── euroleague_rosters.json
├── main.py              # Pre-match pricing pipeline execution
├── requirements.txt
└── README.md
